      "tone": "danger"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "T → F: one counter-model, so the formula is not valid. Had sizes 1–3 all passed, we would have learned nothing about validity: only a proof shows that.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "note",
     "set": {
